# Windows PlatformIO home if it leaks into project dir when pio runs under WSL2
# (C:\Users\baltz\.platformio resolves as a relative path in Linux)
# Both slash variants are needed: git on Linux normalises to "/" internally.
C:/
C:\
"C:\\Users*"
C:\\Users*
